                           <p class="card-text">
                              <p class="card-text"><span>The Clarendon College Financial Aid Office is committed to serving you in bridging
                                    the gap between the cost of education and what you can afford to pay.</span></p>
                           </p><a href="/financialaid.html" target="New window" class="btn btn-default">Financial Aid</a></div>
                     </div>
